# The one image in this tree (tiles/Dockerfile) builds from the REPO ROOT, because the server links
# the library under src/. Everything listed here is host output or history, never build input, and
# without this line-up the whole native Dawn checkout and the whole git history are tarred and sent
# to the engine before the first instruction of the build runs.
.git/
build/
vendor/
tiles/cache/
tiles/testdata/
